rrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-amber-400 underline hover:opacity-80 font-medium\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-824\"><img aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-824\" loading=\"lazy\" data-attachment-id=\"824\" data-permalink=\"https://wardianst.wordpress.com/2016/03/29/desain-kaos/gtk-ok/#main\" data-orig-file=\"https://wardianst.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/gtk-ok.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"717,519\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{\"aperture\":\"0\",\"credit\":\"\",\"camera\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"created_timestamp\":\"0\",\"copyright\":\"\",\"focal_length\":\"0\",\"iso\":\"0\",\"shutter_speed\":\"0\",\"title\":\"\",\"orientation\":\"1\"}\" data-image-title=\"GTK OK\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://wardianst.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/gtk-ok.jpg?w=717\" src=\"https://wardianst.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/gtk-ok.jpg?w=300\" alt=\"GTK OK\" width=\"300\" height=\"217\" srcset=\"https://wardianst.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/gtk-ok.jpg?w=300 300w, https://wardianst.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/gtk-ok.jpg?w=600 600w, https://wardianst.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/gtk-ok.jpg?w=150 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a><p id=\"caption-attachment-824\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">K2</p></div></p>', 1, '2016-03-29 14:48:49', 'https://wardianst.wordpress.com/2016/03/29/desain-kaos/', 0, '2026-09-06 21:33:58', '2026-09-06 21:33:58'),
